DX machine for Model:Cycles - private port, 2026

Based on the MSFA component distributed with Dexed.
Copyright Google Inc. 2012-2013, Pascal Gauthier 2017-2025 and contributors.
MSFA remains licensed under Apache 2.0, as described by Dexed README.
The Dexed JUCE/plugin wrapper is not included.
Original upstream sources and headers are retained in upstream/.
Modified files are in core/: 32-sample blocks at 48kHz, offline math tables,
ColdFire integer/EMAC kernels, no plugin, MTS, GUI or heap dependency.
Bank import and Cycles UI/voice integration are original port code.
No Yamaha factory cartridge or proprietary ROM data is bundled.
